OL,3,GNEWSAPulling Alfred Russel Wallace from
OL,4,ADarwin's shadow
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Dr George Beccaloni, Alfred Russel
OL,7,FWallace is a life-long obsession.
OL,9,FCharles Darwin's On the Origin of
OL,10,FSpecies was published in 1859 but 15
OL,11,Fmonths earlier, a paper with a much
OL,12,Flonger title came out, co-authored by
OL,13,FDarwin and Wallace.
OL,15,FBeccaloni believes Wallace is
OL,16,Funderappreciated as the co-discoverer
OL,17,Fof natural selection and is dedicated
OL,18,Fto preserving the naturalist and
OL,19,Fexplorer's legacy and his grave in
OL,20,FDorset.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
