OL,3,GNEWSAPulling Alfred Russel Wallace from
OL,4,ADarwin's shadow
OL,5,
OL,6,F"[My wife] has always said that there's
OL,7,Fthree people in our relationship - me,
OL,8,Fher and Wallace," said the evolutionary
OL,9,Fbiologist and science historian.
